WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:12.160
Espera, Walt.

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:14.840
I... I think that

00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:16.600
I don't believe you.

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:18.280
You are too shady.

00:00:18.360 --> 00:00:19.800
You know, maybe tomorrow

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:21.040
it'll turn out that

00:00:21.240 --> 00:00:22.800
this is just another condition

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:24.960
that someone pressured you into.

00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:30.320
Why should I believe you?

00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:34.000
Maybe because I love you.

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:40.120
Curly Pie.

00:00:41.720 --> 00:00:43.920
Miss Gina Rose.

00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:50.000
Will you marry me?

00:00:51.720 --> 00:00:52.840
I don't know.

00:00:52.840 --> 00:00:54.080
What?

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:06.360
I can give you a few more

00:01:06.360 --> 00:01:08.160
compelling arguments...

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:09.960
But...

00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:13.840
maybe not in the hospital.

00:01:16.400 --> 00:01:18.440
So where did you park your car?
